-- src:17384 | 2 An offence under any of the following provisions of the Corruption of Foreign Public Officials Act:
-- src:17385 | a) section 3 (bribing a foreign public official); and
-- src:17386 | b) section 4 (maintenance or destruction of books and records to facilitate or hide the bribing of a foreign public official).
@ref Criminal Code sch XXII.1 para 2 to sch XXII.1 para 2(b) (src:17384-17386)
GIVEN `it is an offence under section 3 of the Corruption of Foreign Public Officials Act (bribing a foreign public official)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is an offence under section 4 of the Corruption of Foreign Public Officials Act (maintenance or destruction of books and records to facilitate or hide the bribing of a foreign public official)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch XXII.1 para 2 the offence is one of those listed` MEANS
    IF `it is an offence under section 3 of the Corruption of Foreign Public Officials Act (bribing a foreign public official)` OR `it is an offence under section 4 of the Corruption of Foreign Public Officials Act (maintenance or destruction of books and records to facilitate or hide the bribing of a foreign public official)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): the schedule lists two sections of the Corruption of Foreign Public Officials Act and does not say that no other offence is covered

-- Fork F-sch-XXII.1-3: "an offence referred to in section 1 or 2" is read as paragraph 1 or 2 of this schedule (the schedule has paragraphs, not sections).
-- src:17387 | 3 A conspiracy or an attempt to commit, being an accessory after the fact in relation to, or any counselling in relation to, an offence referred to in section 1 or 2.
@ref Criminal Code sch XXII.1 para 3 (src:17387)
GIVEN `it is a conspiracy or an attempt to commit, being an accessory after the fact in relation to, or any counselling in relation to, an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the offence is one referred to in paragraph 1 or 2, by sch XXII.1 para 1 or para 2` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch XXII.1 para 3 the conspiracy, attempt, accessory or counselling is one of those listed` MEANS
    IF `it is a conspiracy or an attempt to commit, being an accessory after the fact in relation to, or any counselling in relation to, an offence` AND `the offence is one referred to in paragraph 1 or 2, by sch XXII.1 para 1 or para 2` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): the schedule lists the conspiracy, attempt, accessory and counselling limbs and does not say that no other offence is covered

-- The schedule as one answer, for the sections that ask for it (sections 715.32(2) and 715.43(2) and (3), in another part): the offence, or the offence that a conspiracy, an attempt, an accessory after the fact or a counselling relates to, is one that paragraph 1 or paragraph 2 names (paragraph 3).
